and Confidence\n- Overall score (1-6)\n- Confidence (1-5: 1=low, 5=expert)\n- Brief justification\n\nOutput a complete structured review. Do NOT write any code or make edits. This is pure analysis.\n","uuid":"77bdbefa-31bb-4a07-a7f0-6158527ecc18","session_id":"f97ff991-0e8f-42e6-bed2-f413306c2d1e"}
