{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WBQTNrwz9ZxgKiznrotLca","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 vla-ssd 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (45 个)\\n\\n- **lg_extract_trained_r1**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **mvp2_delta_dino**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp2_delta_untrained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp2_delta_trained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp2_action_dino**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp2_action_untrained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp2_action_trained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **dinov2_baseline**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_controlb_untrained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_controlb_trained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_001**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_probe_untrained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_probe_trained**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **openvla-untrained-extract**: DONE (success) — \\n- **openvla-trained-extract**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-16\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n（无）\\n\\n## 待处理\\n（无）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **lg_instruction_ablation** (killed): D021 Exp-1: Instruction Ablation. Extract LIBERO-Goal features with empty instruction (trained + untrained VLA), then run RSA. If instruction pathway is the source of action-relevant structure, RSA should collapse from ρ≈0.49 to <0.15. PASS: ρ<0.15; PARTIAL: 0.15<ρ<0.30; FAIL: ρ≥0.30.\\n- **lg_output_head_analysis** (killed): D021 Exp-2: Output Head Analysis. Compare trained vs untrained VLA weight differences across layers. If training does \\\"shallow adaptation\\\", output head weight diff >> middle layer weight diff. Explains \\\"representations unchanged but behavior improved\\\".\\n- **plan_012_clip_vit_control** (success): —\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 30 / 负向 7 / 失败 0 / 共 45\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestd-19183: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n- mvp2_action_probe: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- lg_extract_trained_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- lg_extract_untrained_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- lg_extract_trained_r1: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- lg_extra