{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014GktWjuTEWo4sjHFgtwQFa","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 36\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 11:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 三分支判定标准校准：ρ下限0.3→0.5, Δρ加bootstrap CI, subtask gate加DINO baseline对比\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查发现四项校准缺陷：(1) ρ>0.3 下限过低（DINO-V2 已达0.833，0.3只挡彻底失败）→ 提至0.5；(2)\\\\n    Δρ>0.1 仅为点估计缺统计检验 → 追加 bootstrapped 95% CI must exclude 0；(3) subtask_AUC>0.7\\\\n    无 baseline 锚点（不知道 DINO-V2 能做到多少）→ 增加条件 subtask_AUC > DINO_subtask_AUC + 0.05；(4)\\\\n    layer profile 不入正式判定但作为 mandatory supplementary analysis。修改后标准更严谨，降低 false positive\\\\n    PASS 风险。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dino-v2-baseline\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: ρ=0.833\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 12:02 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 判定全面切换到 per-task mean ρ，弃用 pooled ρ\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 pooled ρ 受 cross-task variance 膨胀（DINO pooled=0.833 vs per-task\\\\n    mean=0.554）。pooled-vs-pooled 虽对称但偏严（可能 false negative）。切换 per-task mean 与 task-level\\\\n    bootstrap CI 方法论一致，且是更公平的 apples-to-apples 比较。影响：VLA≥DINO gate 从 ρ≥0.833 变为 per-task\\\\n    mean≥0.554；ρ>0.5 下限同样改为 per-task mean。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dinov2_baseline\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: pooled ρ=0.833, per-task mean=0.554\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 12:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: 移除 subtask AUC gate，MVP 判定简化为纯 temporal distance (ρ) 路径\\\\n  rationale: DINO-V2 subtask AUC = 0.9717，Path B 要求 VLA > DINO + 0.05 = 1.0217，数学不可达（AUC\\\\n    上限 1.0）。根因：subtask 间视觉差异大，任何强视觉编码器都能高 AUC 区分——subtask discrimination 不是 VLA 的差异化能力。Temporal\\\\n    distance（连续进度信号）才是 VLA 可能独有的编码维度。简化后判定：PASS 需 VLA_ρ ≥ DINO_ρ (0.833)；CONDITIONAL\\\\n    需 Δρ > 0.1 但 VLA_ρ < DINO_ρ；FAIL 需 ρ ≤ 0.5 或 Δρ ≤ 0.1。Subtask AUC 保留为补充分析，不参与\\\\n    gate。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dinov2_baseline\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: subtask AUC 0.9717 使 Path B 数学不可达\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 12:35 UTC\\\\n  summary: D003 勘误：DINO gate 阈值从 0.833 (pooled) 修正为 0.554 (per-task mean)，与 D002 对齐\\\\n  rationale: D003 写 ROADMAP 时误用 pooled ρ 0.833 作为 DINO gate 阈值，但 D002 已明确\\\\\\\"全面切换到 per-task\\\\n    mean ρ，弃用 pooled\\\\\\\"。DINO per-task mean ρ = 0.554。0.833 vs 0.554 差 0.28，直接影响 PASS/FAIL\\\\n    判定——用 0.833 会错误地将本应 PASS 的结果判为 CONDITIONAL。修正后所有文档/代码统一使用 per-task mean。同时确认 analyze_mvp.py\\\\n    废弃决策不变（urgent 指令已发）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dinov2_baseline\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: pooled ρ=0.833, per-task mean ρ=0.554\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 13:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: D004 DINO gate 阈值作废：0.554→0.901。旧值基于 500 pairs/task 的噪声结果，新管道 5000 pairs/task\\\\n    下 DINO per-task mean ρ=0.9008\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer CRITICAL: 新管道 rerun DINO-V2 基线，per-task mean ρ 从 0.554 暴涨至\\\\n    0.901（10x 采样密度消除噪声）。旧管道 pooled/per-task 差异(0.833/0.554)是采样伪影。Gate 3 阈值必须更新为 0.901，否则\\\\n    analyze_results.py 判定标准错误。dinov2_baseline registry metrics 标为 invalidated。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dinov2_baseline\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: 旧 metrics invalidated; rerun per-task mean ρ=0.9008\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_probe_trained\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: layers 1-5 ρ≈0.950\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_probe_untrained\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: layers 1-5 ρ≈0.925, Δρ max 0.043\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 13:32 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'DINO baseline invalidated: 旧管道 ρ=0.554 作废，新管道 ρ=0.901。Gate 3 阈值更新为 0.901。Gate\\\\n    2 预判高风险（layers 1-5 max Δρ=0.043 << 0.1）'\\\\n  rationale: Worker 用更新后的 train_probes.py 重跑 DINO baseline，per_task_n_pairs 从 500→5000，per-task\\\\n    mean ρ 从 0.554 暴涨至 0.901。旧结果系统性低估——所有 10 task 均在 0.84-0.93（旧值 0.41-0.68）。D001-D004\\\\n    的判定标准建立在错误基线上。同时 trained(ρ≈0.95) vs untrained(ρ≈0.93) vs DINO(ρ≈0.90) 三者差距极小，temporal\\\\n    distance 信号主要来自 vision encoder 而非 LLM 训练。等待 33 层全结果确认。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dinov2_baseline\\\\n    role: invalidated baseline\\\\n    result: 旧 ρ=0.554 作废，新 ρ=0.901\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_probe_trained\\\\n    role: running probe\\\\n    result: layers 1-5 mean ρ≈0.95\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_probe_untrained\\\\n    role: running control\\\\n    result: layers 1-5 mean ρ≈0.93, Δρ<0.05\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 13:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP Gate 2 FAIL 确认：33 层全结果，非坍塌层最大 Δρ=0.043 << 0.1。Temporal distance 信号来自\\\\n    vision encoder 而非 VLA 训练。Pivot 到 subtask predicate probe + 实用 pipeline 双线验证\\\\n  rationale: '完整 33 层数据：trained best ρ=0.956(L3), untrained best ρ=0.933(L1), DINO\\\\n    ρ=0.901。非坍塌层 Δρ 范围 0.003-0.043，无任何层接近 0.1 阈值。Gate 1 PASS(ρ>>0.5), Gate 2 FAIL(Δρ<<0.1),\\\\n    Gate 3 PASS(0.956>0.901)。科学结论：temporal distance 信号主要来自 SigLIP vision encoder，LLM\\\\n    fine-tuning 贡献 ~2-4% ρ，统计显著但实质极小。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    Pivot 理由：temporal distance 与 visual change 高度相关，vision encoder 天然擅长，不是测试 VLA 训练贡献的好\\\\n    probe。IDEA_BRIEF 原计划包含 subtask predicate classification（is_grasped, is_on_table\\\\n    等离散语义属性），这类信号需要理解 action 语义而非视觉相似度，vision encoder 不应有优势。先快速验证 subtask probe 是否展示\\\\n    VLA-specific 贡献，同时推进实用 pipeline（VLA ρ=0.95 已足够强，不管信号来源，self-scoring 可行）。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_probe_trained\\\\n    role: primary probe\\\\n    result: best L3 ρ=0.956, 33 layers complete\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_probe_untrained\\\\n    role: control C\\\\n    result: best L1 ρ=0.933, Δρ max=0.043\\\\n  - exp_id: dinov2_baseline\\\\n    role: baseline (rerun)\\\\n    result: ρ=0.901\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 13:58 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP Gate 2 确认 FAIL（clean verdict）。Subtask predicate probe 是最后一道 VLA-specific\\\\n    signal 测试，48h 内出 CoRL go/no-go。\\\\n  rationale: P0 修复后 33 层全量结果：非坍塌层 max Δρ=0.043 << 0.1，CI [0.036, 0.050] 排除零但效应量不足。根因：temporal\\\\n    distance ≈ visual change，SigLIP 天然擅长（untrained ρ=0.933）。Subtask predicate probe（BDDL\\\\n    predicates）测试 VLA 是否编码离散 action-semantic 属性，但 DINO auto-extracted subtask AUC=0.97\\\\n    构成高 baseline 风险。设 48h 决策窗口：subtask probe 结果 + Control B 完成后做 CoRL go/no-go。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_probe_trained\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'negative: Δρ=0.043'\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_probe_untrained\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: 'success: ρ=0.933 baseline'\\\\n  - exp_id: dinov2_baseline\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: 'success: ρ=0.901'\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_controlb_trained\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_controlb_untrained\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 14:04 UTC\\\\n  summary: Subtask predicate pivot 终止。DINO auto-extracted subtask AUC=0.9717 > 0.95\\\\n    gate，所有 BDDL predicates 视觉可辨，VLA 训练无独特优势。转向 action prediction probe 调研。\\\\n  rationale: LIBERO tabletop 场景中 is_grasped/is_on_table/is_in_drawer 等 predicates\\\\n    在第三人称+手腕相机下视觉可辨，纯视觉模型即可高精度分类。根本问题：需要\\\\\\\"视觉不可达\\\\\\\"的 probing task 才能体现 VLA LLM 训练的独特贡献。Action\\\\n    prediction（预测 next action）需要策略知识，vision encoder 天然不擅长，是最有潜力的候选方向。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dinov2_baseline\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: DINO subtask AUC=0.9717\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_probe_trained\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: Δρ=0.043 insufficient\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_probe_untrained\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: untrained ρ=0.933 vision-dominated\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 14:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: 批准 Action Prediction Probe 作为 MVP-2 方向。设定三门判定：G1 R²>0.3, G2 ΔR²(trained-untrained)>0.15,\\\\n    G3 ΔR²(trained-DINO)>0.15\\\\n  rationale: Temporal distance (D007) 和 subtask predicate (D009) 均因\\\\\\\"视觉可辨\\\\\\\"失败。Action\\\\n    prediction 需策略知识，vision encoder 不擅长，是区分 VLA 训练贡献的合理 probing task。数据现成（LIBERO HDF5\\\\n    自带 7-DoF action），特征可复用，运行快（~20min），低风险高信息量。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_probe_trained\\\\n    role: predecessor\\\\n    result: Δρ=0.043, temporal distance 视觉可辨\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_probe_untrained\\\\n    role: predecessor\\\\n    result: baseline for G2 comparison\\\\n  - exp_id: dinov2_baseline\\\\n    role: predecessor\\\\n    result: ρ=0.901, 证明 temporal distance 视觉可辨\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_controlb_trained\\\\n    role: running\\\\n    result: label permutation control\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_controlb_untrained\\\\n    role: running\\\\n    result: label permutation control\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 14:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: Control B 两组实验均确认 null hypothesis（shuffled labels ρ≈0），probe 方法论完全验证。关闭\\\\n    MVP 实验系列。\\\\n  rationale: 'Trained features + shuffled labels: 33 层全部 |ρ|<0.013，信噪比 73:1。Untrained\\\\n    features + shuffled labels: 33 层全部 |ρ|<0.01，信噪比 104:1。结合 DINO Control B (ρ=0.039,\\\\n    信噪比 23:1)，三模型均通过 null control。证明 temporal distance probe 观测到的 ρ=0.955/0.933/0.901\\\\n    是真实信号，非 probe 过拟合或数据泄漏。MVP 实验系列（mvp_001 到 Control B）全部完成，结论：temporal distance\\\\n    信号主要来自 vision encoder，VLA 训练贡献 Δρ=0.043（统计显著但实质不足）。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_controlb_trained\\\\n    role: null control\\\\n    result: max |ρ|=0.013, PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_controlb_untrained\\\\n    role: null control\\\\n    result: max |ρ|=0.009, PASS\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_probe_trained\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: ρ=0.955, Δρ=0.043\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_probe_untrained\\\\n    role: control C\\\\n    result: ρ=0.933\\\\n  - exp_id: dinov2_baseline\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: ρ=0.901\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 14:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D012: Copy baseline R²=0.97 暴露 G1 阈值无效。增加 action-delta prediction 作为核心判定指标，修订\\\\n    MVP-2 gates。'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 copy baseline（a_{t+1}=a_t）R²=0.97，根因是机器人轨迹平滑导致连续 action 自相关极高。原\\\\n    G1（R²>0.3）毫无区分力，G2 的 Δ 也可能被压缩——与 MVP-1 的 vision dominates 结构性同构。解决方案：预测 action-delta（Δa\\\\n    = a_{t+1} - a_t），copy baseline 对 Δa 的 R² 恒为 0，彻底消除自相关混淆。当前实验继续不中断，完成后用相同 features\\\\n    重新训练 probe 即可（分钟级）。修订 gates：G1 保留为 sanity check；新增 G1-delta（trained peak-layer\\\\n    R²(Δa)>0.05）和 G2-delta（Δ(trained-untrained) on Δa >0.03 且 ≥5/10 tasks 一致）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_action_trained\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_action_untrained\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 15:25 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP-2 Action Prediction 综合判定：G3-delta FAIL（DINO 0.061 ≈ trained 0.059）。三条探测维度（temporal\\\\n    distance / action prediction / action-delta）均 vision-dominated。唯一 VLA-specific\\\\n    发现：layer stability（训练后表征通路稳定，untrained 中间层坍塌）。建议 pivot 到 LIBERO-Goal instruction-conditioned\\\\n    probing。\\\\n  rationale: MVP-2 完整结果：G1 PASS (0.683>0.3), G1-delta borderline PASS (0.059>0.05),\\\\n    G2 FAIL (best-vs-best Δ=0.067<0.15), G3-action FAIL (Δ=0.007), G3-delta FAIL (DINO\\\\n    0.061 ≥ trained 0.059)。G2-delta Agent 报 PASS 但存在 best-vs-best vs same-layer 口径差异需核实。核心问题：DINO\\\\n    单层（1024 dim）在 action 和 action-delta 上均匹配 trained VLA 33 层最优（4096 dim），说明 LIBERO-10\\\\n    中的 action 信号（包括高阶 delta）可从视觉状态推断。VLA 训练的唯一可探测效果是 layer stability——表征通路畅通（trained\\\\n    31/33 层 R²>0.45, untrained 仅 ~15/33 层有效），但内容质量（可预测的信息量）未超越纯视觉。这与 Grant et al.\\\\n    2026 的发现一致：LIBERO-10 是 vision-solvable benchmark，language 几乎被忽略。LIBERO-Goal（多目标共享视觉场景）是文献支撑最强的下一步——该场景中\\\\n    vision 无法区分 goal，必须依赖 instruction。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_action_trained\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: action R²=0.683(L19), delta R²=0.059(L14)\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_action_untrained\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: action R²=0.616(L32), delta R²=0.049(L32)\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_action_dino\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: action R²=0.676, delta R²=0.061 — matches trained VLA\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 15:26 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP-2 判死：action prediction + action-delta 三轮 probing 一致确认 LIBERO-10 上 VLA\\\\n    训练未注入视觉编码器以外的独特信息。Pivot 到 LIBERO-Goal instruction-conditioned probing。\\\\n  rationale: 三轮 probing 结果一致：(1) temporal distance Δρ=0.043, (2) raw action ΔR²=0.067(T-U)/0.007(T-DINO),\\\\n    (3) action-delta ΔR²=0.012(T-U)/-0.001(T-DINO, DINO 反超)。DINO 单层 1024-dim 在所有指标上打平或超过\\\\n    trained VLA 33 层 4096-dim。根因：LIBERO-10 单目标 tabletop 场景视觉状态强烈约束 action 空间，无需语言或策略推理消歧。文献支撑\\\\n    pivot：Grant et al. 2026 发现 LIBERO-Goal 多目标场景中 language 贡献关键（正确 prompt 94% vs 错误\\\\n    10%）。唯一正面发现：VLA 训练创造了跨层稳定表征（trained 31/33 层 > untrained），但这是 representational\\\\n    reorganization 而非 new knowledge，单独不足以撑论文。Agent 报告的 G2-delta PASS 有误——best-vs-best\\\\n    Δ=0.012 < 0.03，0/10 tasks 超过阈值，实为 FAIL。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_action_trained\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: best L19 R²=0.683, delta best L14 R²=0.060\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_action_untrained\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: best L32 R²=0.616, delta best L32 R²=0.048\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_action_dino\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: R²=0.676 action, R²=0.061 delta — matches or exceeds trained\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_probe_trained\\\\n    role: predecessor\\\\n    result: temporal distance ρ=0.955, Δρ=0.043\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_probe_untrained\\\\n    role: predecessor\\\\n    result: temporal distance ρ=0.933\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D010\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: '选择 Option A: Pivot 到 LIBERO-Goal instruction-conditioned probing。Reviewer\\\\n    独立评估一致推荐，预期 CoRL 录用概率 15-30%（vs Option B 的 5-12%），且 worst case 退化为加强版 B。'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立评估结论：(1) Expected value 最高——LIBERO-Goal positive 时构成 \\\\\\\"vision-sufficient\\\\n    vs vision-ambiguous\\\\\\\" 对比叙事，FAIL 时退化为双 benchmark negative（仍优于纯 Option B）；(2) 实验成本极低（特征提取\\\\n    ~半天 GPU + probe 复用）；(3) Layer-wise mechanistic insight 是 vs Grant et al. 2026\\\\n    的差异化卖点——Grant 只做了 behavioral（input-output），我们提供 WHERE/HOW 的 representational 证据；(4)\\\\n    11 天内可行（7-9 天实际工作量）。关键风险：OpenVLA checkpoint 仅在 LIBERO-10 fine-tune，未见过 LIBERO-Goal\\\\n    多目标场景。缓解：先检查 scene overlap，必要时做 LIBERO-Goal fine-tune（+1 天）。用户授权：\\\\\\\"你们确定好怎么走我就同意\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_action_trained\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: action-delta R²=0.059, DINO ≈ trained, vision-dominated\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_action_dino\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: delta R²=0.061, matches trained VLA\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: LIBERO-Goal 实验统一用 base pretrained OpenVLA checkpoint（非 LIBERO-10 fine-tuned）。同时用\\\\n    pretrained 重提 LIBERO-10 特征，确保跨 benchmark 对比公平——唯一变量是 benchmark，非 fine-tuning 状态。\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 checkpoint 不一致 confound：LIBERO-10 用 fine-tuned、LIBERO-Goal\\\\n    用 pretrained → reviewer 会攻击差异来自 fine-tuning 而非 benchmark 特性。Solution 1（base pretrained\\\\n    统一）最 clean：(1) 唯一变量是 benchmark，排除 fine-tuning confound；(2) 如果 pretrained VLA 已编码\\\\n    instruction grounding，novelty 更高（pretraining 产物 vs task-specific fine-tuning 产物）；(3)\\\\n    额外 GPU 成本仅 3h，当前 GPU 空闲正好利用；(4) 与 Grant et al. 差异化更清晰（Grant 用 OFT fine-tuned，我们用\\\\n    pretrained）。附带发现：Grant 的 100%→10% 效应来自 OpenVLA-OFT 而非 base，我们效应量可能小一些但更有说服力。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_action_trained\\\\n    role: predecessor (fine-tuned)\\\\n    result: R²=0.683, will re-extract with pretrained\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_action_dino\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: R²=0.676, unchanged\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:22 UTC\\\\n  summary: D016 修正：改用 LIBERO-10 fine-tuned checkpoint 统一提取两个 benchmark 特征（取代 base\\\\n    pretrained 方案）。LIBERO-Goal 是 OOD 测试——场景不重叠，positive 结果 = 泛化而非记忆。\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 二次审视后提出更优方案：(1) fine-tuned checkpoint 在 LIBERO-Goal 上是 OOD——场景确认不重叠、指令未见过，positive\\\\n    结果直接证明 instruction grounding 泛化能力，story 更强；(2) LIBERO-10 特征已提取完毕无需重跑，省 3h GPU；(3)\\\\n    同一 checkpoint 跨两个 benchmark = 公平对比，唯一变量仍是 benchmark 特性；(4) base pretrained 可作为后续\\\\n    ablation 补充（如果 fine-tuned 结果 positive 且时间允许）。此决策取代 D016 的 base pretrained 方案。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_action_trained\\\\n    role: existing features\\\\n    result: LIBERO-10 fine-tuned features already extracted, reusable\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 19:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: G3-GC FAIL 确认为维度混淆方法论问题，启动 PCA-1024 + linear probe 控制实验\\\\n  rationale: Untrained VLA bin 0 = 100%（与 trained 相同），证伪 \\\\\\\"language grounding from\\\\n    training\\\\\\\" 原 claim。根因是 4096-dim MLP probe 对 10 类分类 capacity 过大（Hewitt & Manning\\\\n    2019）。需要 PCA 降维到 1024（与 DINO 对齐）+ linear probe 消除维度和 probe complexity 混淆后重新判定。暂定\\\\n    Option C framing（Methodology + Temporal Dynamics），最终取决于 PCA 结果。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: lg_gc_untrained\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: G3-GC FAIL, Δ(trained-untrained)=0pp\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 19:44 UTC\\\\n  summary: Goal classification probing 方法论失败，pivot 到 Representational Similarity Analysis\\\\n    (RSA) 测试 training 是否改善 action-relevant 表征结构\\\\n  rationale: Goal classification 无法区分 trained vs untrained VLA（5 个实验变体全部 ~100%）。根因：两者都接收\\\\n    instruction text 作为输入，即使 random LLM 的高维投影也能完美分离 10 个不同文本的 goal。这不是维度/probe 选择问题，而是任务设计根本缺陷——测的是\\\\\\\"表征是否包含\\\\n    instruction 信息\\\\\\\"（trivially yes），而非\\\\\\\"training 是否改善 instruction encoding\\\\\\\"。DINO 低(35%→97%)是因为没有\\\\n    instruction 输入，不是 language grounding 差异。下一步用 RSA 测量 representation space 与 action\\\\n    space 的结构对齐程度，这避免了 trivial separability 问题。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: lg_gc_trained_frame0\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: trained 100% L3+\\\\n  - exp_id: lg_gc_untrained\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: untrained also 100%\\\\n  - exp_id: lg_pca1024_linear_pertimestep\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'PCA-1024 linear: trained 99.9% vs untrained 100%'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 19:51 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D020: RSA success gates 定义 + 要求在 LIBERO-Goal 上优先运行（cross-goal same-scene\\\\n    RDM），kill dead-end GPU 进程'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer WARNING: RSA 启动无 gate 定义，重复 D001-D014 教训。补定 gates：G1 trained\\\\n    best-layer RSA ρ(repr RDM, action RDM) > 0.15；G2 Δρ(trained-untrained) > 0.08\\\\n    且 bootstrap 95% CI 排除 0；G3 trained ρ > DINO ρ（任何正 margin）。关键设计约束：LIBERO-Goal 的\\\\n    same-scene/different-goal 对是核心——DINO 在这些对上 visual RDM 高度相似但 action RDM 完全不同，预期\\\\n    RSA ρ 接近 0 或为负；trained VLA 应展示 goal-conditioned action structure，ρ 应显著高于 untrained\\\\n    和 DINO。同时 Reviewer 发现 GPU 上仍有两个已关闭路线的进程（PID 650060, 648231），应 kill 释放资源。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: lg_rsa_analysis\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: running, gates now defined\\\\n  - exp_id: lg_gc_untrained\\\\n    role: predecessor\\\\n    result: goal classification dead\\\\n  - exp_id: lg_pca1024_linear_pertimestep\\\\n    role: predecessor\\\\n    result: PCA+linear confirmed trivial separability\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D019\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 20:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D021: Framing pivot 到 Option B \\\\\\\"Architecture Trumps Training\\\\\\\"。5 轮 probing\\\\n    一致 G1+G3 PASS / G2 FAIL → VLA 架构提供 instruction conditioning，训练不改变表征结构。启动 instruction\\\\n    ablation + output head analysis 验证。'\\\\n  rationale: 6 轮实验（temporal distance, action prediction, action-delta, goal classification,\\\\n    RSA）× 2 benchmark（LIBERO-10, LIBERO-Goal）一致模式：trained ≈ untrained >> DINO。训练效应从未超过\\\\n    noise level（最大 Δρ=0.043）。三个 framing 备选中选 Option B 理由：(1) positive framing——\\\\\\\"架构设计驱动\\\\n    instruction conditioning\\\\\\\"比\\\\\\\"训练无用\\\\\\\"更 actionable；(2) 与 Grant 2026 互补（他们发现 behavioral\\\\n    \\\\\\\"encoded but not used\\\\\\\"，我们发现 representational \\\\\\\"not even encoded differently\\\\\\\"）；(3)\\\\n    只需 instruction ablation（1 个实验）验证机制——去掉 instruction 后 RSA 应 collapse，证明 architecture\\\\n    pathway 是关键；(4) output head analysis 补充解释行为改善如何在表征不变时发生（\\\\\\\"shallow adaptation\\\\\\\"）。Option\\\\n    C（random LLM sufficiency）作为 B 的自然推论在 Discussion 中讨论，不作为主 claim（需要 LLM size ablation，时间不够）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: lg_rsa_analysis\\\\n    role: final confirming evidence\\\\n    result: G1 PASS ρ=0.49, G2 FAIL Δρ=0.003, G3 PASS Δ=0.10\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_probe_trained\\\\n    role: temporal distance\\\\n    result: G2 FAIL Δρ=0.043\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_action_trained\\\\n    role: action prediction\\\\n    result: G2 FAIL ΔR²=0.067\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_action_dino\\\\n    role: action-delta baseline\\\\n    result: G3-delta FAIL, DINO ≈ trained\\\\n  - exp_id: lg_gc_untrained\\\\n    role: goal classification\\\\n    result: untrained 100% = trained\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D019\\\\n  - D020\\\\n  - D015\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 20:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D021: RSA G2 FAIL (Δρ=0.003 << 0.08)。6 轮 probing 一致确认 VLA 训练不改变表征结构。Go/no-go\\\\n    决策点：推荐 Option A \\\\\\\"Representational Redundancy\\\\\\\" negative finding paper for CoRL'\\\\n  rationale: 6 轮系统性 probing（temporal distance / subtask / action prediction / action\\\\n    delta / goal classification / RSA）× 2 benchmarks（LIBERO-10 vision-sufficient +\\\\n    LIBERO-Goal vision-ambiguous）× 多种 probe（MLP/linear/PCA/RSA/CKA），全部呈现一致模式：G1 PASS（VLA\\\\n    表征编码 task-relevant 信息）、G2 FAIL（trained ≈ untrained，训练不改变表征内容）、G3 PASS（VLA >> DINO，架构提供\\\\n    instruction conditioning）。RSA 的 CKA 深层 0.85-0.86 进一步确认 trained-untrained 表征几何高度相似。原\\\\n    hypothesis \\\\\\\"VLA training contributes meaningful language grounding\\\\\\\" 被系统性否定。但 consistent\\\\n    negative + mechanistic insights (layer stability, temporal specialization) 本身构成有文献价值的发现——推翻\\\\n    VLA 领域 \\\\\\\"fine-tuning injects new representational knowledge\\\\\\\" 的隐性假设。三个 framing 备选：A)\\\\n    Representational Redundancy（最少额外实验）, B) Architecture Trumps Training（需 ablation）,\\\\n    C) Random LLM Sufficiency（需 LLM size ablation）。推荐 Option A：直接利用全部现有证据，仅需 output\\\\n    head analysis 补充 mechanism。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: lg_rsa_analysis\\\\n    role: final probe\\\\n    result: G1 PASS (ρ=0.488), G2 FAIL (Δ=0.003), G3 PASS (+0.10)\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_probe_trained\\\\n    role: temporal distance\\\\n    result: Δρ=0.043\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_action_trained\\\\n    role: action prediction\\\\n    result: G3 FAIL, DINO ≈ trained\\\\n  - exp_id: lg_gc_untrained\\\\n    role: goal classification\\\\n    result: untrained 100% = trained 100%\\\\n  - exp_id: lg_pca1024_linear_pertimestep\\\\n    role: PCA+linear control\\\\n    result: Δ=-0.08pp\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D019\\\\n  - D020\\\\n  - D014\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 20:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D023: Reviewer 共识——B framing 可行但 claim 需收窄为 \\\\\\\"instruction input pathway\\\\\\\"，instruction\\\\n    ablation 为 hard gate，FAIL 则回退 Option A'\\\\n  rationale: 两份独立 Reviewer 报告一致指出：(1) \\\\\\\"architecture\\\\\\\" 一词 overclaims——当前证据只证明 \\\\\\\"VLA pathway（含\\\\n    instruction 输入）>> 纯视觉\\\\\\\"，未 ablate 具体组件（text encoder / LLM backbone / fusion），应精确到\\\\n    \\\\\\\"instruction input pathway\\\\\\\"；(2) instruction ablation 是 blocking experiment，非 nice-to-have——没有它\\\\n    \\\\\\\"architecture provides instruction conditioning\\\\\\\" 是 speculation 不是 conclusion；(3)\\\\n    layer stability（31/33 vs 15/33）与 \\\\\\\"training doesn't change representation\\\\\\\" 存在内部张力，需定位为\\\\n    \\\\\\\"reorganization without new knowledge injection\\\\\\\"；(4) output head analysis 重要但非\\\\n    blocking（可放 Discussion）；(5) 最大 reviewer attack surface 是单 VLA 架构，scope 必须限定为 OpenVLA-class。采纳全部建议，设\\\\n    instruction ablation 为 hard gate：PASS 则锁定 B，FAIL 则立即回退 A。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: d021_instruction_ablation\\\\n    role: blocking_gate\\\\n    result: PREPARING\\\\n  - exp_id: d021_output_head_analysis\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: PREPARING\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n  - D022\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 20:15 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D023: Reviewer 评估 D021 framing — 接受 claim 精度建议，记录 attack surface 应对'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer warning 级别评估 D021 \\\\\\\"Architecture Trumps Training\\\\\\\" framing。关键采纳：(1)\\\\n    claim 从 \\\\\\\"architecture\\\\\\\" 精确到 \\\\\\\"instruction input pathway\\\\\\\"；(2) instruction ablation\\\\n    是 critical path，FAIL 则切 Option A；(3) \\\\\\\"trivial separability\\\\\\\" 攻击需 random instruction\\\\n    control 回应（research 阶段第一优先）；(4) Grant checkpoint 差异 + 单 VLA 架构限制需在 Discussion/Limitations\\\\n    处理。不采纳：trivial separability 严重度被高估——RSA 测量 representation-action geometry correspondence\\\\n    而非分类，但 control 实验仍值得做。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: d021_instruction_ablation\\\\n    role: critical_path\\\\n    result: PREPARING\\\\n  - exp_id: d021_output_head_analysis\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: PREPARING\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n  - D022\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 20:17 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D024: Instruction ablation gate 从绝对阈值改为 DINO-anchored 相对标准'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出绝对阈值 0.30 缺乏锚定依据。改用 DINO RSA 作为锚点的相对标准：PASS 要求 no-instruction\\\\n    RSA 显著下降（Δ>0.10, CI 排除 0）且退化到 DINO 水平；FAIL 要求去掉 instruction 几乎无影响（Δ<0.05）；中间为\\\\n    INCONCLUSIVE。这避免了 \\\\\\\"RSA=0.38 接近 DINO 但按绝对阈值判 PASS\\\\\\\" 的假阳性。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: d021_instruction_ablation\\\\n    role: gate_definition\\\\n    result: PREPARING\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D023\\\\n- id: D026\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 20:19 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D025: Output head analysis FAIL — shallow adaptation 不成立，发现 projector\\\\n    bottleneck 机制'\\\\n  rationale: Head/LLM ratio = 1.12x (阈值 3x)，权重差异均匀分布于 LLM 32 层。但关键发现：SigLIP + Projector\\\\n    在 trained/untrained 间完全相同（rel_change=0, cos_sim=1.0），说明 untrained model 的 from_config()\\\\n    只重初始化 LLM。这提供了 trained≈untrained 的精确机制：frozen projector bottleneck 约束表征空间，使得下游\\\\n    LLM 权重（即使 cos_sim≈0.2 完全不同）无法改变表征结构。Shallow adaptation → Discussion 中 ruled-out\\\\n    hypothesis。Projector bottleneck → 替代机制解释。Caveat：当前比较是 pretrained+finetuned vs\\\\n    random init LLM，差异被 pretrained vs random 主导，但这恰恰是最强测试——如果极端不同的 LLM 都不影响表征，中间态更不会。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: d021_output_head_analysis\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: FAIL_but_informative\\\\n  - exp_id: d021_instruction_ablation\\\\n    role: complementary\\\\n    result: RUNNING\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D024\\\\n- id: D027\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 22:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D027: Instruction Ablation FAIL — Option B 死亡，回退 Option A。选择 A2 \\\\\\\"Vision\\\\n    Encoder Dominance\\\\\\\" framing，SigLIP frozen encoder 是 action-relevant 表征的真正来源'\\\\n  rationale: 'Instruction ablation 结果：去掉 instruction text 后 untrained RSA ρ=0.4802\\\\n    vs with-inst ρ=0.4846，Δ=0.0044 远低于 0.10 阈值。no-inst RSA=0.48 远高于 DINO+0.05=0.438。Gate\\\\n    双 FAIL。Instruction pathway 不是 action-relevant 结构来源。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    综合全部证据链：(1) trained ≈ untrained（6 轮 probing 一致）；(2) VLA >> DINO（一致）；(3) instruction\\\\n    不影响 RSA（ablation 证实）；(4) SigLIP+projector frozen（output head analysis 证实）。唯一一致解释：SigLIP\\\\n    frozen vision encoder 决定了 action-relevant 表征结构。选 A2 framing 理由：指向具体组件，因果链清晰，与\\\\n    Grant 2026 互补（behavioral→representational），实用价值高（选 encoder 比 fine-tuning LLM 重要）。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    需补充 SigLIP-only features 提取 + RSA 作为 smoking gun 验证（不过 LLM 直接测 SigLIP 输出的 RSA），以及\\\\n    trained no-inst RSA 完成 2×2 matrix。两个实验完成 + positive → complete_mvp。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: d021_instruction_ablation\\\\n    role: hard_gate\\\\n    result: 'FAIL: Δ=0.0044 << 0.10, no-inst RSA=0.48 >> DINO+0.05'\\\\n  - exp_id: d021_output_head_analysis\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: 'negative but informative: projector bottleneck mechanism'\\\\n  - exp_id: lg_rsa_analysis\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: 'with-inst RSA: trained 0.49, untrained 0.48, DINO 0.39'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D023\\\\n  - D026\\\\n- id: D028\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 22:26 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D028: SigLIP-only RSA smoking gun PASS (0.615 >> 0.488)。LLM 是 degrader\\\\n    而非 passthrough。complete_mvp 批准，A2 framing 升级含 LLM degradation claim'\\\\n  rationale: 'SigLIP+Projector RSA = 0.615，远超 Gate 阈值 0.45-0.50，也远超 full VLA 的 0.488。证明\\\\n    action-relevant 表征结构完全来自 frozen vision encoder。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    意外发现：LLM 不是 passthrough 而是 degrader（0.615→0.488），无论 trained/untrained、with/without\\\\n    instruction。2×2 matrix 四格全部收敛于 0.48-0.49，Bootstrap CI 包含 0。Per-layer analysis\\\\n    确认 instruction 对任何层无实质影响（max |Δ|<0.015）。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    A2 framing 升级为三个 core claims：(1) action-relevant 表征源自 frozen SigLIP encoder；(2)\\\\n    LLM processing 降低 action-relevant 结构（degrader，非 passthrough/enhancer）；(3) training\\\\n    和 instruction 均不改变表征结构。Claim 2 是 novel contribution——无已有论文测量过 projector output\\\\n    vs LLM hidden state 的 RSA 差异。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    批准 complete_mvp，进入 research/writing 阶段。CoRL abstract DDL May 26（11天），paper DDL\\\\n    May 29（14天）。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: d027_siglip_only_rsa\\\\n    role: smoking_gun\\\\n    result: 'PASS: RSA=0.615, far exceeding 0.45-0.50 gate and full VLA 0.488'\\\\n  - exp_id: d027_trained_no_inst_rsa\\\\n    role: 2x2_completion\\\\n    result: All 4 cells converge at 0.48-0.49, training x instruction both null\\\\n  - exp_id: d021_instruction_ablation\\\\n    role: per_layer_analysis\\\\n    result: max |delta|<0.015 across all layers\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D027\\\\n  - D023\\\\n- id: D029\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 22:43 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D029: Claim 2 聚合伪影排除。VLA image_mean RSA=0.501 仍远低于 SigLIP 0.615（gap=0.114），LLM\\\\n    degradation 是真实效应。Per-layer 分析显示降解集中在 Proj→L1 界面，中间层部分恢复'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer CRITICAL 指出 SigLIP 用 mean pooling vs VLA 用 last_preaction 不公平。验证结果：改用完全相同的\\\\n    image_mean 聚合后，trained VLA RSA=0.5014（vs last_preaction 0.4876，差异仅 0.014），仍远低于\\\\n    SigLIP 0.6153。Gap=0.114，LLM degradation ~18.5%，排除聚合伪影。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    Per-layer degradation curve 补充 nuance：(1) 降解主要在 Proj→L1 界面（drop 0.13-0.25）；(2)\\\\n    3/4 条件非单调，中间层部分恢复；(3) no-inst trained 独特呈 L1→L30 持续上升。Claim 2 措辞应精炼为 \\\\\\\"LLM input\\\\n    interface introduces primary degradation; subsequent layers partially recover\\\\n    but net degradation persists (~18%)\\\\\\\"。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    论文应同时呈现 last_preaction 和 image_mean 两种聚合的 RSA 作为 robustness check。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: d027_siglip_only_rsa\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: RSA=0.6153 (mean pooling)\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_003_perlayer_degradation\\\\n    role: supplementary\\\\n    result: Proj→L1 drop 0.13-0.25, non-monotonic recovery\\\\n  - exp_id: d027_trained_no_inst_rsa\\\\n    role: aggregation_check\\\\n    result: 'image_mean RSA: trained 0.5014, untrained 0.4847'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D028\\\\n- id: D030\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 23:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D030: Dream 三档均低于 acceptance（best borderline reject, median 5/10, worst\\\\n    4/10）。6 个结构性问题识别，P0 行动：functional validation via projector-output action probe'\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream 审稿三档一致指出 6 个结构性问题：(1) 无功能验证——RSA geometric alignment 不等于 task\\\\n    performance，是论文最大弱点；(2) 单架构 claim 过广；(3) confirmatory of concurrent behavioral\\\\n    work；(4) related work 严重不足；(5) LIBERO-only；(6) degradation framing 争议。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    P0 行动——functional validation 实验：在 projector output features 上训练 linear action\\\\n    predictor，对比 best LLM layer（已有 R²=0.683 from MVP-2）和 DINO（R²=0.676）。如果 projector\\\\n    R² ≥ LLM best → \\\\\\\"degradation is functional\\\\\\\" 从 correlational 升级为 causal evidence，彻底回应\\\\n    D1+D6。Features 已提取，probe 代码可复用，CPU/minimal GPU，~1h。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    P1 行动——scope claims to OpenVLA, 提升 trained≈untrained 为核心 novelty, 扩充 related work,\\\\n    加 figures。\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    framing + plan 改动后必须 re-dream 验证。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: d027_siglip_only_rsa\\\\n    role: features_source\\\\n    result: projector output features available for action probe\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_action_trained\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: LLM best layer R²=0.683\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp2_action_dino\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: DINO R²=0.676\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D028\\\\n  - D029\\\\n- id: D031\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 23:43 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Claim 2 framing pivot: \\\\\\\"LLM degrades\\\\\\\" → \\\\\\\"LLM redistributes\\\\\\\" — functional\\\\n    probe reveals LLM degrades image tokens (0.706→0.683) but concentrates action\\\\n    signal to readout token (0.731)'\\\\n  rationale: plan_011 functional validation 揭示了比 RSA 更丰富的图景：(1) Projector R²=0.706\\\\n    > LLM image_mean 0.683 确认 image token 级别的功能性降解；(2) 但 LLM last_preaction 0.731\\\\n    > Projector 0.706（bootstrap p=0.001），说明 LLM 的 attention 机制将分散的 action 信号聚合到 readout\\\\n    token。新 framing \\\\\\\"redistribution\\\\\\\" 比 \\\\\\\"degradation\\\\\\\" 更准确、更 interesting、且直接回应 Dream\\\\n    审稿 W3 concern（\\\\\\\"degradation framing interpretively problematic\\\\\\\"）。Core insight 不变：vision\\\\n    encoder 是 action information 的源头，LLM 的贡献是 readout/concentration 而非 new information\\\\n    injection。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: p0_functional_action_probe\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: Projector R²=0.706 > LLM image_mean 0.683, but LLM last_preaction 0.731\\\\n      > Projector. PASS with nuance.\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D030\\\\n- id: D032\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 23:47 UTC\\\\n  summary: Confirm Option A framing (\\\\\\\"LLM routes, not creates\\\\\\\"); functional probe\\\\n    needs re-run with bootstrap CI for main comparison + DINO probe\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer CRITICAL: (1) projector vs image_mean_trained (0.706 vs 0.683)\\\\n    缺 bootstrap CI，当前 PASS 无统计检验支撑；(2) DINO probe 未包含，缺三方对比。Delta probe BELOW 但 CI\\\\n    含 0。Agent 提出三个 framing option，选 A（\\\\\\\"96.6% functional capacity already in projector,\\\\n    LLM contributes routing not knowledge\\\\\\\"）——最平衡，保持 redistribution 叙事同时 defensible。修正后重跑是\\\\n    re-dream 前置条件。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: p0_functional_action_probe\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'PASS pending stat verification: proj 0.706 vs LLM img_mean 0.683 (CI\\\\n      needed), readout 0.731 (p=0.001)'\\\\n  - exp_id: p0_functional_action_delta_probe\\\\n    role: secondary\\\\n    result: 'BELOW: proj 0.118 < LLM 0.122, CI includes 0, not significant'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D031\\\\n- id: D033\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 23:54 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'DINO R²=0.712 ≈ Projector R²=0.706 (p=0.22) — Claim 1 reframe: geometric-functional\\\\n    dissociation. SigLIP advantage is geometric alignment (RSA), not predictive content\\\\n    (R²)'\\\\n  rationale: V2 probe 发现 DINO functional R²=0.712，与 SigLIP projector 0.706 无显著差异（p=0.22）。但\\\\n    RSA 维度 SigLIP (0.615) >> DINO (0.388)。这意味着：(1) action-relevant 信息在视觉编码器中是 ubiquitous\\\\n    的，不是 VL pretraining 独有；(2) VL pretraining 的价值在于 geometric organization（让表征几何结构与\\\\n    action 结构对齐），而非增加 predictive content。这个 geometric-functional dissociation 本身是一个新颖发现，可以强化论文。Claim\\\\n    1 从 \\\\\\\"SigLIP dominance\\\\\\\" 调整为 \\\\\\\"vision encoders universally contain action info +\\\\n    VL pretraining provides geometric alignment\\\\\\\"。旧 DINO 数字 0.676（MVP-2）已过时，V2 的 0.712\\\\n    是同一框架内的可信数字。仍需补 untrained last_preaction (C001) 和调查 MVP-2 vs V2 差异。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: p0_functional_probe_v2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'DINO CLS R²=0.712, Projector R²=0.706, p=0.22 NS. Bootstrap projector\\\\n      vs img_mean: delta=+0.023, CI=[0.011, 0.037], p<0.001 confirmed.'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D031\\\\n  - D032\\\\n- id: D034\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 00:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Untrained last_preaction R²=0.689 < projector 0.706: redistribution is\\\\n    training-dependent. Claim 2 add qualifier, Claim 3 split by aggregation'\\\\n  rationale: C001 untrained 对照完成。Untrained readout best (L1, 0.689) < projector (0.706)\\\\n    < trained readout (L19, 0.731)。这意味着：(1) LLM 的 readout concentration 不是架构固有属性，需要训练才能超过\\\\n    projector baseline；(2) Claim 3 (training invariance) 在 image_mean 维度成立（distributed\\\\n    representation invariant）但在 last_preaction 维度不成立（readout concentration training-dependent）。综合\\\\n    story：VLA training 的贡献不是注入新的 action knowledge（image_mean invariant），而是学习将已有的 visual\\\\n    action information 高效路由到 output position（readout concentration learned）。这与 \\\\\\\"LLM\\\\n    routes, not creates\\\\\\\" (Option A) 完美一致，且比纯 \\\\\\\"training invariance\\\\\\\" 更有深度。需补 untrained\\\\n    vs trained last_preaction bootstrap CI 做统计确认。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: p0_functional_probe_v2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: Untrained last_preaction best L1 R²=0.689 < projector 0.706. L12-L18 +\\\\n      L24-L31 all collapsed to chance (0.059). Training-dependent redistribution confirmed.\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D031\\\\n  - D033\\\\n- id: D035\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 01:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: Paper Agent 与 re-dream 并行启动。Dream 卡在 writing 3h+，不再等待。\\\\n  rationale: Re-dream (dream_20260516T011810) 启动 3h+ 仍停在 writing 阶段（updated_at 未变）。所有\\\\n    P0 证据已闭合（6/6 前置条件满足），三条 Claim 定稿，writing_plan.yaml 就绪。距 CoRL abstract DDL 仅 10\\\\n    天，继续等待 dream 是不可接受的时间风险。决定：立即启动 Paper Agent Full Draft，dream 如完成则用反馈迭代。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_008_random_inst_control\\\\n    role: final_evidence\\\\n    result: instruction content invariant, 6/6 prerequisites met\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260516T011810\\\\n    role: validation\\\\n    result: stuck in writing stage 3h+\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D031\\\\n  - D033\\\\n  - D034\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 33877, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FdaDoUwPaaGrWcwk1KQjfd","session_id":"f97ff991-0e8f-42e6-bed2-f413306c2d1e","uuid":"be19fbb4-254c-44a3-b4cb-fd06624ce0b0","timestamp":"2026-05-16T01:42:09.230Z"}
